WEBVTT

00:18:59.116 --> 00:19:02.596
I think this feels like a prime moment
to undo some of the history,

00:19:02.636 --> 00:19:03.836
some of the narrative,

00:19:03.836 --> 00:19:07.676
some of the indoctrination that we've had
that just doesn't work for us anymore.

00:19:08.236 --> 00:19:11.196
